cff-version: 1.2.0
title: claudectl
message: >-
  The workspace layer for Claude Code. Note that an unrelated Rust project also
  publishes under the name "claudectl"; this entry describes the Python package
  at https://pypi.org/project/claudectl/.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Babar Muhammad
    family-names: Anas
    website: 'https://claudectl.space'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/babarmuhammad/claudectl'
url: 'https://claudectl.space'
version: 1.9.0
date-released: '2026-09-04'
abstract: >-
  A workspace layer for Anthropic's Claude Code CLI. Browse, search, tag, fork
  and resume every session across every project and account; maintain a semantic
  project memory that is injected within a token budget; manage MCP servers,
  agents, skills and hooks; and see what a turn costs, read from your own
  transcripts. Terminal UI and desktop GUI over one engine, with zero runtime
  dependencies.
keywords:
  - claude-code
  - developer-tools
  - terminal-ui
  - session-manager
  - context-management
  - mcp
license: MIT
